07:51:32\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-07.webp\",\"id\":\"1HEUIBsG0TgRZZg5mSqYTNaOcGZpTr_Cz\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:33\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-08.webp\",\"id\":\"1JFVeJ-pUHkmPy0mgWQu_5PYVFaS8iPNV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:36\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-09.webp\",\"id\":\"1Ce-TTudf5Vl4IaLkSe840gtgLE-Ush8f\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:40\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-10.webp\",\"id\":\"1dMR8Wh_u-4GG28PQNAJhcFEGq0_6Cami\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:44\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-11.webp\",\"id\":\"1nNkfOcx1aLnE58DR3Zi_7tpauxq7wYVg\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:52\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-12.webp\",\"id\":\"1eiM8VjAsCKZxWpmnakdHNRESi-fWIW2o\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:54:55\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-13.webp\",\"id\":\"1hsAeF9aaxb--DKaH-R5CiBYQ0yMaIa9Z\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:00\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-14.webp\",\"id\":\"1u06kBAfHvgGtT8xgTbwwk_egBhV5LiDN\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:08\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-15.webp\",\"id\":\"1EzF9nH8hgFAimVAxXyhwNeSuUi7PEx1u\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:11\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-16.webp\",\"id\":\"185yz5LYSARhzJHtx7_TbanD8IoRRSwZb\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:17\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-17.webp\",\"id\":\"1zUDPSOFBb9E-dL7YnIoTguL9F75M239-\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:20\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-18.webp\",\"id\":\"1tjXeSqFRUnznEO2HVWnHGjymuKNnOjIh\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:24\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-19.webp\",\"id\":\"13RKS__MjU_GdvM5brpoe5HG6uCjUDRuO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:27\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-20 (1).webp\",\"id\":\"1K3i_wbKl0JPxB6qPa92LA3w3UjkxhrDQ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:30\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-20.webp\",\"id\":\"1c2rU8Evt9ZBzNtDY5pCE_fQxvlJtasrv\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:33\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-22.webp\",\"id\":\"14ufrGIdHdL8lwQCS9c9rX-VQ20iAoTOd\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 07:55:36\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-01.webp\",\"id\":\"1fs70KfLZV6WJPmTfM3847HQOVcGtj3qZ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:28:54\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-02.webp\",\"id\":\"1meTtg7_DGobnScy-tRkpPUaxIjSbYRIW\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:28:58\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-03.webp\",\"id\":\"1FLtp40YOpYjWJRf2Q5FOxhY2jENJPBRO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:29:01\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-04.webp\",\"id\":\"13ez_QyxEUfWBXtz-qy7qVxrjk_BkPI75\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:29:04\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-05.webp\",\"id\":\"19QcyGMOWRgAIJdf-GJjjqN7C_KLvuUSu\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:29:08\"},{\"name\":\"feb-2025-cf-06.webp\",\"id\":\"14MGH5pEIxuDJW_woBd3kBjOmQe0eGJtc\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:29:11\"}]', 'Events', 'February Company Fellowship', 'February-Company-Fellowship', '2025-02-28', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFebruary, often celebrated as the month of love, provided the perfect backdrop for Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. (FBS) to embrace the spirit of unity and camaraderie through our monthly Company Fellowship. With the theme \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" this gathering served as a reminder of our collective commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe event commenced with inspiring opening remarks from our Operations Manager, Sir Ralph Acoba, who emphasized that a workplace built on love, respect, and genuine care is one that thrives. His words set the tone for an uplifting and engaging gathering that strengthened our sense of community and shared purpose.\n</p>\n \n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nOne of the highlights of the fellowship was the warm welcome extended to our new on-the-job trainees from various schools and universities. At FBS, we believe in not only providing technical training in web design and development but also in immersing our trainees in our vibrant company culture. By involving them in our activities, we aim to create a well-rounded experience that fosters both professional and personal growth.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nWe also had the pleasure of welcoming two new employees from the Virtual Assistant Department, Mr. Miguel Neil Nunez and Ms. Maria Sasha Camille Panlaqui. Their addition to the team marks another step forward in strengthening our workforce and enhancing our services.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nAnother significant moment was the recognition of our Employee of the Month, Mr. Ivan Dominic Gonzales from the Virtual Assistant Department. His dedication, hard work, and commitment to excellence were truly commendable, making him a role model for his colleagues.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nIn the spirit of celebration, we also took the time to honor our employees and trainees with February birthdays. The joy and excitement were evident as everyone shared in the festivities, reinforcing the strong bonds within our team.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nAdding a unique and insightful touch to the event, we engaged in an interactive activity focused on understanding love languages. Through small group discussions and a simple questionnaire, employees gained valuable insights into their own and their colleagues’ preferred ways of giving and receiving appreciation. This exercise strengthened relationships and enhanced workplace communication, reinforcing the importance of empathy and understanding in a professional setting.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nTo cap off the celebration, a photo booth with a love-themed backdrop was set up, allowing employees to capture fun and heartfelt moments together. The decorations, filled with hearts and symbols of warmth, created an atmosphere of joy and connection, making the event even more memorable.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nOur February Company Fellowship was more than just a gathering—it was a testament to our commitment to fostering a culture of love, teamwork, and continuous growth. As we move forward, we remain dedicated to raising the bar and reaching far, ensuring that FBS continues to be a workplace where people flourish both professionally and personally.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 07:50:39', '2025-03-25 08:29:18'),
(34, 1, '[{\"name\":\"spc-main-photo.webp\",\"id\":\"186Jr3hbXxXvyMGvTBcanGNip3JyDE-D2\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:46:40\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"spc-img-10.webp\",\"id\":\"1ikMNaMYAypUPYX5155ciSRoeT_nGW7wo\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:46:48\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-11.webp\",\"id\":\"13zkG2pJ8ugMl2pbFabmtEilPCh9miZ7Y\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:46:51\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-12.webp\",\"id\":\"1Hqm6h2kJtJL4dJd3EMTOA7jOD8sRj7Z-\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:46:54\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-13.webp\",\"id\":\"1UOBlSxnOWvVXL3hi57m5TxfUmRtyXLzX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:46:56\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-14.webp\",\"id\":\"16oONh9U6gpwhUPy17Au1xOADRibqDaIS\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:00\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-15.webp\",\"id\":\"1LsFpNR2aoR5Wpo2EZNQJMA_bbuNSslTj\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:02\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-16.webp\",\"id\":\"1UvL-k0VMeeocknOkQQomMgBQJM0grx-9\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:05\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-17.webp\",\"id\":\"1NiZio7Gwv0I_5GUXsX61jClkHLmZ72la\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:08\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-18.webp\",\"id\":\"1NnCYksXttBAl-yBaioThxkCsF4qDuCr7\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:10\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-19.webp\",\"id\":\"1hIUzkenUjsJY75221VYAK4VV3fBAX60-\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:13\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-5.webp\",\"id\":\"1-vrEivtOOiJN3nvaZ0E_IG8wVnUUyk-Q\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:16\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-6.webp\",\"id\":\"1LigtSxnIxjHPYo2FFzvAViCO3YkZPT_e\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:19\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-7.webp\",\"id\":\"1bPa1G9rfwHx7IfooTK1hjVg7OWDjrpoE\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:21\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-8.webp\",\"id\":\"1Tct-xQbAfPZpCdV3y9Jn2yOpfjdANCic\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:24\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-9.webp\",\"id\":\"1AMM2iPwlnzL4r8L6B8JaRpdHXvHxrbjx\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:47:27\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-0.webp\",\"id\":\"1JS15-QONIiPbkwEQ8epqiAIwv3N9Hio3\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:50:40\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-00.webp\",\"id\":\"1PNOIBNJqk0mWGtCVTMx0i4d3TjIuVwYD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:50:43\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-1.webp\",\"id\":\"1ab97S4sRWnxYOpPI_q1HDuUyggRwhyDn\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:50:46\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-2.webp\",\"id\":\"17Cqfahghdn8HwvlG6nUtcmRtYyxj8dn6\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:50:51\"},{\"name\":\"spc-img-4.webp\",\"id\":\"1hAQTq0Uo7Zm9eWV-MH8Dl5Ib3IZ16SUH\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:50:54\"}]', 'Events', 'San Pablo Colleges Renews Partnership with FBS for Senior High School Work Immersion Program', 'SPC-Renews-Partnership-with-FBS', '2025-02-24', '<ul class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 items-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\n    <li><img class=\"w-[180px] h-[180px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/spc.png\" alt=\"SPC\"></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with San Pablo Colleges (SPC) for the Senior High School Work Immersion Program, specifically for students under the Information Communication Technology (ICT) strand. This collaboration continues to provide invaluable work-related experience in web design and development, equipping students with essential technical skills for their future careers.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n    <b>Figma Designing\n    </b>\n</p>\n \n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nStudents will learn the fundamentals of UI/UX design using Figma, an industry-standard tool for creating wireframes, prototypes, and user interfaces. They will gain experience in designing visually appealing and functional web pages.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n    <b>Web Development with HTML and CSS\n    </b>\n</p>\n \n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nParticipants will be introduced to front-end web development, where they will learn to structure and style websites using HTML and CSS. This foundational training will allow them to create responsive and well-designed web pages.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThese 33 students will begin their work immersion on February 24, engaging in real-world projects under the guidance of experienced professionals. They will develop critical problem-solving skills, creativity, and a deeper understanding of industry workflows. This immersive experience will not only enhance their technical proficiency but also prepare them for future opportunities in the digital and IT sectors.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nAs Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. continues to uphold its mission of providing high-quality training and mentorship, the company looks forward to another productive year of empowering the next generation of IT professionals through this partnership with San Pablo Colleges. Together, we are shaping the future of young talents by equipping them with the necessary skills to thrive in the fast-evolving digital landscape.\n\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFor more information about our work immersion programs, feel free to contact Frontline Business Solutions, Inc.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 08:46:37', '2025-03-25 08:50:37'),
(35, 1, '[{\"name\":\"scslb-img-0.jpg\",\"id\":\"1oui6Z1Q_xrMa6GVWz1tJAx4ViS22UlF1\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:42\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"img-0.jpg\",\"id\":\"1b1cbDW_IkXjIv4s7MaJhJltyNBlNpnbM\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:45\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-1.webp\",\"id\":\"1I08HceyCMLqTXxSHgmfq9tA5GUhbpm6x\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:48\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-10.webp\",\"id\":\"1hbCrFQ2huO12rrh7-Zhn63EhNImsuGLg\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:53\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-10a.webp\",\"id\":\"1TpMZAvu-hlfoyxUa5DTCEO0_SppJxfcU\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:55\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-11.webp\",\"id\":\"1W66pjeZGERgX7xTFdaJ5oYJZK2FMv806\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:57:58\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-12.webp\",\"id\":\"1BhRdWSbXSu923j77CDUgwq1Yiwg4cjYx\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:01\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-2.webp\",\"id\":\"1Fo8nJySIkROHCPSCIzTcPi8RJ7FeUN21\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:04\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-3.webp\",\"id\":\"16MMUifZQUUqxFnrtfhWJ53vZnUNOKNdV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:07\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-4.webp\",\"id\":\"1A6fJFMx1C_4N7ZMrvIsfzxjEcgC6OT83\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:09\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-5.webp\",\"id\":\"1lrcmR45HY2NzOPJdxFcg3qMoZe9TQ9Tm\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:12\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-6.webp\",\"id\":\"1ud15y0ZlJlsbGOZ0f80U90MlEA0hia05\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:15\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-7.webp\",\"id\":\"1dn_S4ffh8ho9s9adzLqf1xGu2YPyVVus\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:18\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-8.webp\",\"id\":\"1AD7fh8zZ98FggDJl8NCsgYmpE4kzYAWR\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:21\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-img-9.webp\",\"id\":\"1U6bP-kUpmbgug4h8R6qTayrrJ5OxpEU_\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 08:58:24\"}]', 'Events', 'Servite Catholic School STEM Students Complete Senior High School Work Immersion in Web Design and Development', 'Servite-Catholic-School-STEM-Students-Complete-Senior-High-School-Work-Immersion-in-Web-Design-and-D', '2025-02-19', '\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe partnership between Servite Catholic School and Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. has taken another successful step forward with the completion of the Senior High School Work Immersion Program for STEM students from Laurel, Batangas. This immersive experience in IT-related work, specifically in web design and development, has not only enriched students’ technical knowledge but has also strengthened the collaborative relationship between educators and industry professionals.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThroughout the program, students engaged in hands-on learning, applying theoretical knowledge to real-world projects. They explored various aspects of web designing using Figma, front-end web development, and website optimization. Under the mentorship of industry practitioners, they gained valuable insights and practical skills that will serve as a strong foundation for their future careers in the IT field.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nBeyond technical proficiency, the immersion program fostered personal and professional growth among students. They learned problem-solving techniques, teamwork, and project management skills—essential competencies for thriving in the fast-paced digital industry. This experience has significantly enhanced their readiness to pursue higher education or enter the workforce with confidence.\n</p>\n \n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nMoreover, the program has deepened the connection between Servite Catholic School and Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. Through continuous collaboration, school administrators and teachers are committed to providing students with relevant, work-related experiences that align with their chosen fields. This ongoing partnership ensures that future batches of students will have the opportunity to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry practice.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe successful completion of this work immersion program stands as a testament to the shared vision of Servite Catholic School and Frontline Business Solutions, Inc.—to equip students with the skills, knowledge, and confidence needed to excel in the IT industry. Moving forward, both institutions look forward to strengthening their collaboration, fostering more opportunities for students to gain real-world experience, and shaping the next generation of IT professionals.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 08:57:39', '2025-03-25 08:57:39'),
(36, 1, '[{\"name\":\"1000029379.webp\",\"id\":\"102llExJ8O2qKYXmsiTpQh43pIyfalEq_\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:02\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"1000029361.webp\",\"id\":\"1NnHgxVxmbn05IAWU-l-G9y0LsFLvBUGK\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:05\"},{\"name\":\"1000029362.webp\",\"id\":\"1Eb5KGFogrfIQ_rB2z-SA1MpArR6L4MtX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:10\"},{\"name\":\"1000029364.webp\",\"id\":\"1wVO0bRfAFYQGoaP5J8hXnb62VskG_iLk\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:14\"},{\"name\":\"1000029365.webp\",\"id\":\"1r60JKqN5BupBPvSViMhVH9AF_Dltl6yF\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:17\"},{\"name\":\"1000029366.webp\",\"id\":\"1bW3J7O-ff5_0mbcrTF5MQ7RxPAG0MntO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:19\"},{\"name\":\"1000029367.webp\",\"id\":\"1qPsqqDuhZ7f7gZ88HcZ74pEvkkZn2vx4\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:23\"},{\"name\":\"1000029369.webp\",\"id\":\"1nvZdx2oTPXh45CUB3JioO2rUdFjh0kLq\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:27\"},{\"name\":\"1000029371.webp\",\"id\":\"10cLeNE_hv5_dFpve_gp7WUVd799hXJRp\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:30\"},{\"name\":\"1000029373.webp\",\"id\":\"1MS79RkM_g0rIlDSh7e1ZboAoiKr3RbfO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:34\"},{\"name\":\"1000029375.webp\",\"id\":\"1Vh9h2yqiIzsbQpt7L9LjUcnOR0EpVVMD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:06:36\"}]', 'Events', 'FBS Partners with STI College San Pablo for ICT Work Immersion Program', 'FBS-Partners-with-STI-College-San-Pablo-for-ICT-Work-Immersion-Program', '2025-02-18', '<ul class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 items-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\n    <li><img class=\"w-[180px] h-[180px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/sti.png\" alt=\"STI\"></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. (FBS) proudly announces its new partnership with STI College San Pablo to provide Senior High School (SHS) students with valuable real-world work experience in Web Design and Development. This collaboration is part of STI’s Work Immersion Program, which aims to equip ICT students with hands-on training in industry-relevant skills.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  The partnership was made official through the efforts of Mrs. Guillerma Tajao, SHS Assistant Principal, and Mrs. Angelou Almare-Medina, Program Head of the IT Department, who recognized the importance of bridging academic learning with workplace experience.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    As part of the company’s commitment to equipping students with industry-ready skills, the training will focus on real-world applications in web design and development. The trainees will gain hands-on experience and practical knowledge in key areas such as:\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n    <b>Bridging Education and Industry\n    </b>\n</p>\n \n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Through this program, STI College San Pablo students will have the opportunity to work alongside industry professionals at FBS, gaining practical experience in modern web technologies. The learning outcomes of the work immersion include:\n</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:decima;list-style-position:outside;margin-bottom:30px;margin-left:10px\">\n    <li>Designing Website Mockups and UI using Figma</li>\n    <li>Developing Responsive Web Designs</li>\n    <li>Converting Mockup Designs into Actual Web Pages (HTML/CSS)</li>\n    <li>Applying Basic Scripting with JavaScript</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    This structured work immersion allows students to develop both technical skills and workplace competencies, making them industry-ready upon graduation.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n    <b>A Commitment to Future IT Professionals\n    </b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n   At Frontline Business Solutions, Inc., we believe in nurturing young talents by providing them with the right platform to grow and excel. This partnership with STI College San Pablo reflects our ongoing commitment to skills development, mentorship, and career readiness for aspiring IT professionals.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nWe look forward to mentoring the next generation of web developers and supporting their journey toward successful careers in the IT industry.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nWelcome, STI College San Pablo ICT students! Your journey to becoming future-ready professionals starts here!\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 09:05:59', '2025-03-25 09:05:59'),
(37, 1, '[{\"name\":\"IMG_20250211_120842.jpg\",\"id\":\"1S-n45xCfrjxt66FD3kkSeXbR-UH9sUWC\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:41\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"1000025671.jpg\",\"id\":\"1VelZd0ETM9Sv0UHEluAXSaFSoXf0AozV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:45\"},{\"name\":\"1000025672.jpg\",\"id\":\"1BW2LpKP9LGK7Z_6nwbFmG2vzl7wkem9U\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:47\"},{\"name\":\"1000025673.jpg\",\"id\":\"1WxXpy_hO1VXe9G3fo3HuyI8_JFYBiVe6\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:50\"},{\"name\":\"1000025674.jpg\",\"id\":\"17PIjIOnJnmEMLNr5v-OTmDHPemS11q6E\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:54\"},{\"name\":\"1000025675.jpg\",\"id\":\"1i_xQAHOVez95U-Zf5pmxBsuZqgS71Wg5\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:23:57\"},{\"name\":\"1000025683.jpg\",\"id\":\"1k_uJ2rM9vIb3hqi_K4CcyH2p41WzVWai\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:24:00\"},{\"name\":\"1000025684.jpg\",\"id\":\"1_EgIes8PNoW1dUdZI2lu5FqWx6Vzqpgo\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:24:03\"},{\"name\":\"1000025686.jpg\",\"id\":\"1-g4fulOn2_mdOLom6GgeYc1cIxF9cGJX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:24:07\"},{\"name\":\"1000025688.jpg\",\"id\":\"1A2GqmHVXns91iJAQkQ75nngx_LbJZ1vi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:24:10\"}]', 'Events', 'New Batch of College Interns', 'new-batch-of-college-trainees', '2025-02-11', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. welcomes a fresh batch of college trainees for its On-the-Job Training (OJT) program in Web Design and Development. This batch consists of students from various colleges and universities, including:\n</p>\n\n<ul class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 items-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/aclc.png\" alt=\"ACLC\"></li>\n\n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/dlsl_official_logo.png\" alt=\"DLSL\"></li>\n    \n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/bsu.png\" alt=\"BSU\"></li>\n    \n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/lspu.png\" alt=\"LSPU\"></li>\n    \n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/sti.png\" alt=\"STI\"></li>\n    \n    <li><img class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] object-contain\" src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/ub.png\" alt=\"UB\"></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:disc;list-style-position:inside;margin-bottom:30px;\">\n    <li>ACLC - San Pablo\n    </li>\n    <li>Batangas State University - Alanguilan\n    </li>\n    <li>De La Salle University - Lipa\n    </li>\n    <li>Laguna State Polytechnic University - San Pablo City Campus\n    </li>\n    <li>STI San Pablo\n    </li>\n    <li>University of Batangas\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    As part of the company’s commitment to equipping students with industry-ready skills, the training will focus on real-world applications in web design and development. The trainees will gain hands-on experience and practical knowledge in key areas such as:\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\n    <b>Learning Outcomes:\n    </b>\n</p>\n    \n<ol style=\"list-style-type:decima;list-style-position:outside;margin-bottom:30px;margin-left:10px\">\n    <li><b>Website Mockup and UI Design with Figma</b> <p>Creating visually appealing and user-friendly website designs using Figma.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Mockup to Web Conversion (HTML/CSS)</b>  <p>Translating design mockups into fully functional web pages with structured HTML and styled CSS.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Responsive Web Design</b>  <p>Ensuring websites adapt seamlessly across different devices and screen sizes.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Basic JavaScript Scripting</b> <p>Implementing dynamic functionalities to enhance website interactivity.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>SASS Technology in Web Conversion</b> <p>Utilizing SASS for efficient styling and modular CSS management.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Tailwind CSS Utility Classes</b>  <p>Building website layouts quickly and efficiently using Tailwind CSS.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Static to WordPress Website Conversion</b> <p>Transforming static websites into dynamic WordPress-powered platforms.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>ReactJS Frontend Development</b> <p>Learning the fundamentals of ReactJS for modern frontend development.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Backend Development with MySQL, CRUD, CORS, and API</b>  <p>Managing databases, performing CRUD operations, and integrating APIs securely.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>Backend Development with Props, State, and Store Context</b> <p>Implementing advanced ReactJS state management techniques for backend interactions.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li><b>ReactJS Project Development</b> <p>Applying all acquired skills in a full-fledged ReactJS project.</p>\n    </li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    This comprehensive training program ensures that trainees are well-equipped with the technical knowledge and practical expertise required in today’s competitive digital landscape. Through hands-on projects and mentorship, they will develop the confidence and skills needed to excel in the web design and development industry.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n   Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. is excited to guide and mentor these aspiring professionals as they take their first steps toward becoming industry-ready developers. We look forward to seeing their growth and contributions in the field of web technology!\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 09:23:37', '2025-03-25 09:23:37'),
(38, 1, '[{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-11.jpg\",\"id\":\"14yQ6pjwEUh4A9pRkwfkGYEwrHVlt44vZ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:41\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1_GFd0HNdpo8PYZ8d76Cvuj6k3k5KqaVe\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:45\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Z9lsUUI9GvgQxaPv-T16q30qwA8gBrfU\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:49\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"13YeYG9oKgYqtD86jmpdbcNAaTiNN9paD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:52\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1e3l3ku-vmm8GO3hcDTqP3r-9kfEovFPp\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:55\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1UzOIHGk1TUsT4F0MZMjSWAGqF32YM1FM\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:27:58\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1d2pMyBrclEXI06zDoEKr7ZCZiZz1NjsV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:28:04\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1CG7F3p9UHr2NWh3xIkZtvUaQ_hanKAMf\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:28:07\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1kHxKoAMMM4g0O01p1sGxqFKwq5YFw3Pk\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:28:10\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"152_cbsD3eUkCNzW-ZNG_IwDrjjximxwG\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:28:13\"},{\"name\":\"st-therese-batch-2-image-9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1vSYxUeDpyzoiCNk0fW3FBgXCrROipBXa\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:28:16\"}]', 'Events', 'St. Therese Montessori School Students Successfully Complete Senior High School Work Immersion', 'St.-Therese-Montessori -School-Students-Successfully-Complete-Senior-High-School-Work-Immersion', '2025-02-07', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. proudly congratulates the Senior High School students from St. Therese Montessori School on the successful completion of their Work Immersion program. Over the past weeks, these students have demonstrated dedication, perseverance, and eagerness to learn as they applied their academic knowledge to real-world business environments. Through hands-on training and mentorship, they have gained invaluable skills essential to their respective academic strands: HUMSS, ABM, and STEM.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\n<b>HUMSS: Bridging Communication and HR Practices\n</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nStudents under the Humanities and Social Sciences (HUMSS) strand engaged in various administrative and human resource tasks, honing their professional communication skills and learning industry standards. Their learning outcomes included:\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:disc;list-style-position:inside;margin-bottom:30px;\">\n<li>Practicing business communication etiquette and professional email correspondence.\n</li>\n<li>Understanding industry standards in human resource policies and procedures.\n</li>\n<li>Familiarizing themselves with Department of Labor and Employment (DOLE) standards and policies.\n</li>\n<li>Creating company memorandums and notices tailored to different work positions and hierarchies.\n</li>\n<li>Conducting job interviews and understanding recruitment processes.\n</li>\n<li>Applying data management, analysis, and reporting using MS Excel advanced formulas and functions.\n</li>\n<li>Processing basic payroll computations.\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\n<b>ABM: Mastering Business and Financial Essentials\n</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nStudents in the Accountancy, Business, and Management (ABM) strand developed practical accounting and financial management skills, reinforcing their classroom knowledge with real-world applications. Their learning achievements included:\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:disc;list-style-position:inside;margin-bottom:30px;\">\n<li>Mastering basic bookkeeping principles and recording financial transactions.\n</li>\n<li>Understanding and applying advanced MS Excel functions for data analysis and financial management.\n</li>\n<li>Learning the fundamental functions and features of QuickBooks Online.\n</li>\n<li>Understanding the components of payroll and preparing Philippine payroll reports in compliance with labor regulations.\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\n<b>STEM: Elevating Digital and Web Development Skills\n</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\nThe Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) students focused on developing their technical and web development skills, preparing them for careers in the digital and IT industry. Their learning highlights included:\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:disc;list-style-position:inside;margin-bottom:30px;\">\n<li>Designing website mockups and user interfaces (UI) using Figma.\n</li>\n<li>Developing responsive web designs to enhance user experience.\n</li>\n<li>Converting mockup designs into actual web pages using HTML and CSS.\n</li>\n<li>Applying basic scripting techniques using JavaScript to create interactive web elements.\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px\">\n<b>A Milestone Achievement for Future Professionals\n</b>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nThe completion of this Work Immersion program marks a significant milestone in the students\' academic and professional journeys. By applying theoretical knowledge to real-world scenarios, they have gained firsthand experience in their chosen fields, preparing them for future careers.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. remains committed to providing high-quality training and industry exposure to Senior High School students, equipping them with skills that will set them apart in their respective industries. We commend the students from St. Therese Montessori School for their hard work and determination and look forward to seeing them thrive in their future endeavors.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nOnce again, congratulations to all the students for their successful completion of the Work Immersion program!\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 09:27:38', '2025-03-25 09:27:38'),
(39, 1, '[{\"name\":\"scslb-0.webp\",\"id\":\"1v5Xp4e7vSwT88LhALQGj-0_HKoKwIB10\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:40\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"scslb-1.webp\",\"id\":\"1htMNt1LtFDXL-WbwwqevjtulWDN9oFOk\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:44\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-2.webp\",\"id\":\"17r9UgyPeYDBLNJPfWmsRYtu-esMbCD80\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:47\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-3.webp\",\"id\":\"1oRBa1HESWmfiqGd1KDyemtefQBsqzF_K\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:50\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-4.webp\",\"id\":\"1_u_dXd0CMaPUshlap08GxnZ-RKv-puYY\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:53\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-5.webp\",\"id\":\"1rVcnby_awVtlMaaONel_srM7ZHiJ_HCs\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:56\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-6.webp\",\"id\":\"1H7kzEpk17wRhDY8vL0D1PYA--B-DQP7a\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:35:59\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-7.webp\",\"id\":\"1fkg7FRpxowjA3AblkTRAvaUAdhEU-Kcp\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:36:02\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-8.webp\",\"id\":\"18HRTU72W0O7LixoqkjBb78KT_dG0ydzi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:36:05\"},{\"name\":\"scslb-9.webp\",\"id\":\"13CMsmflKQHqUw0qjc-GXJZWnwSVJn1sm\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:36:08\"}]', 'Events', 'FBS Announces New Partnership with Servite Catholic School Laurel Batangas', 'fbs-announces-new-partnership-with-servite-catholic-school', '2025-02-03', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. (FBS) is thrilled to announce a new partnership with Servite Catholic School from Laurel, Batangas, marking an exciting collaboration for our Senior High School Work Immersion Program. This partnership strengthens our mission to equip students with real-world industry experience and technical skills.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nAs part of this initiative, STEM students from Servite Catholic School will begin their training on February 10 until February 21, focusing on Web Design and Development. This hands-on program will allow students to develop essential digital skills, gain practical knowledge, and prepare for future careers in the tech industry.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nWe extend our heartfelt gratitude to Sister Rowena Cañete, OSM and the representatives of Servite Catholic School for visiting our office and working closely with us to ensure a seamless deployment process. Their commitment to providing students with valuable learning opportunities is truly commendable.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThis new partnership underscores our dedication to shaping the next generation of tech professionals. We are excited to mentor these talented students and help them build a strong foundation for their future careers. Welcome aboard, STEM students—your journey into the world of technology begins now!\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 09:35:38', '2025-03-25 09:35:38');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_events_activities` (`events_activities_aid`, `events_activities_is_active`, `events_activities_img`, `events_activities_img_list`, `events_activities_category`, `events_activities_title`, `events_activities_slug`, `events_activities_date`, `events_activities_description`, `events_activities_meta_description`, `events_activities_created`, `events_activities_datetime`) VALUES
(40, 1, '[{\"name\":\"january-fellowship.jpg\",\"id\":\"1OAmlNrU23D0R5rYupHBATLF9wVVjm5Bm\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:03\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1QVmvHYuLwEa3UC3X053_d6A5bqk8-cn_\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:06\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1wz6leqXUe0Q1XB_n2RusqoHkRZoMh2wq\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:09\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-11.jpg\",\"id\":\"1KaX6bpsgSD81iFRhSAnf0YTk-3vmpdZV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:12\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-12.jpg\",\"id\":\"18XWB2ZXJ_z9OLQilcO1l_Qcm25ZVCUSq\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:15\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-13.jpg\",\"id\":\"1XgdJJmGxYvNFMS9tZpQkYEH7YPUTF5HO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:18\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-14.jpg\",\"id\":\"1HCWlbSZ7Kx_2aAQA75fuhCp4Z3NiFdCC\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:21\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-15.jpg\",\"id\":\"1DALlUPEBu2ZuUje4NA-ri8Chs0qG-dhS\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:26\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-16.jpg\",\"id\":\"10CBORTiGDF-fnrKA5Tyu7T6hXl-8cafc\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:29\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1maxzUwnAmg2o8lqpTe_dsw5cNZIBQ8ds\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:31\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1ch4tJr11XiRPhUWUkQSs1UjK3Pdau274\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:35\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"11uLLBWmvaZv4MnPZWu4l85Z4GbtynFik\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:37\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1l39fQqfHCPGLiLaeCSfo8nq8pEoUzPZ5\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:40\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1S3xwwmnnQ0sV_96Im-CJS5samDoHdm7j\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:54\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1oCKUNrUbzpeWxSAGNl184hYGSPvfesaj\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:57\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"13mTyIESp8mOQERAZ77rd2OzTFZ3f0Cdv\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:40:59\"},{\"name\":\"january-fellowship-9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1b-LxprDw6_BFPylX49srKiZAP_9amsRr\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:41:02\"}]', 'Activities', 'January Company Fellowship: Pajama Party', 'january-company-fellowship-pajama-party', '2025-01-31', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    This January, Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. kicked off the year with an exciting and meaningful fellowship event aimed at building a culture of camaraderie and fun among employees. With this year’s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" the activity highlighted teamwork, inspiration, and celebration, setting the tone for another successful year.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    The event, organized by the Accounting Team, brought a unique twist to our traditional fellowship by hosting a pajama party – a cozy and delightful way to start the year together. Employees arrived in their comfiest pajamas, adding a lighthearted and relaxed atmosphere to the gathering.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Inspiring Words from Ptr. Jeff Pessina</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    The fellowship began with words of encouragement from our CEO, Ptr. Jeff Pessina, who reminded everyone of our shared mission and vision as a company. His message centered on Ecclesiastes 11:1, which he related to true success in life. He inspired us to aim higher, emphasizing the importance of teamwork, determination, and valuing each team member’s uniqueness in achieving greater goals. His heartfelt words left a lasting impact, motivating everyone to embrace the year’s challenges with optimism and enthusiasm.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Celebrating Excellence: Employee of the Month Award</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Recognizing hard work and dedication is at the heart of our culture. During the event, we proudly awarded the Employee of the Month to a deserving team member whose contributions have gone above and beyond. This recognition not only celebrated individual excellence but also inspired others to strive for success in their respective roles.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Honoring Milestones: Birthday Celebrants Recognition</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    As part of fostering a family-like environment, we took a moment to celebrate the birthday celebrants for the months of November 2024 to January 2025. This simple yet thoughtful gesture reminded everyone that their special moments matter to the company, creating a warm and inclusive atmosphere.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Fun and Games: Bingo Extravaganza</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    What’s a fellowship without some fun and games? The highlight of the event was an exciting Bingo game, where employees competed enthusiastically for prizes. The laughter and cheers during the game reflected the strong bond among team members, proving that a little friendly competition goes a long way in strengthening connections.\n</p>\n    \n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Great Food, Great Company</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Of course, no fellowship is complete without delicious food! Everyone enjoyed a sumptuous spread, sharing meals and stories, further deepening the camaraderie that makes Frontline Business Solutions a special place to work.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    <b>Looking Ahead</b>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    The January Company Fellowship was more than just an event – it was a testament to the thriving culture at Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. As we continue to \"raise the bar\" and \"reach far,\" moments like these remind us of the value of togetherness and shared purpose.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n    Here’s to an exciting year ahead, filled with growth, success, and more opportunities to strengthen our bonds as a team!\n</p>\n    \n', '', '2025-03-25 09:40:00', '2025-03-25 09:40:00'),
(41, 1, '[{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-settings-image-5.jpeg\",\"id\":\"1MScLYzv3gXRmsGAXWbdG7nZWrTFvihgN\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:36\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-setting-image-2 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"16aboFROcljVr94Oog2THrUvRoaCsEWgX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:40\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-setting-image-3 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1b0x5zaQg6HSGyDla-CN_UaE6b4x-csNA\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:43\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-setting-image-4 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1mrWUrlCR-BoVOlqm-9_MD3njtMlIKLwM\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:46\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-setting-image-7.png\",\"id\":\"1Tx94xz3p45lol4ww02phOpX-ph2fOxmt\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:51\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-settings-image-1 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1e_sg6VhU39vB1jbJhcSkovTIcdzbtm1A\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:54\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-settings-image-6 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"118d36N8llc3d_Gh47JhXIY0ItGiMOgpm\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:52:57\"},{\"name\":\"annual-sipervisor-and-admins-planning-and-goal-settings-image-8 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1riBHdZZyS_xGknZyc4SEhE686AlgQL6e\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:53:01\"}]', 'Events', ' 2025 Annual Supervisor’s and Admin’s Planning and Goal Settings', '2025-Annual-Supervisor’s-and-Admin’s-Planning-and-Goal-Settings', '2025-01-27', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. successfully held its annual supervisor\'s and admin\'s planning and goal setting this January 2025. This event, designed to reflect on the past year’s achievements, evaluate departmental performance, and set goals for the year ahead, brought together leaders from all major departments. It was also emphasized that the year\'s company theme is \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far.\" The event was divided into three key sessions: Accomplishment Report, Group Discussion - SWOT Per Department, and Goal Setting for 2025 and Conclusion..\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe event began with each department presenting its 2024 Accomplishment Report, highlighting key milestones and successes achieved during the year. This session fostered a sense of pride and motivated the team to build on their previous achievements.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nIn the second session, each department participated in a SWOT (Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, and Threats) Analysis, identifying areas for growth and improvement. The discussions were collaborative, encouraging input from all attendees. This session provided a comprehensive understanding of internal and external factors affecting each department, paving the way for informed decision-making.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe final session was dedicated to Goal Setting for 2025. Each department outlined specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound (SMART) goals to drive their progress in the upcoming year. The session concluded with an inspiring message from the leadership team, emphasizing collaboration, continuous improvement, and a shared commitment to excellence.\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  <b>Looking Ahead</b>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe 2025 Annual Supervisor’s and Admin’s Planning and Goal Settings set a strong foundation for a productive year ahead at Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. With clear goals and actionable strategies, the company’s departments are well-positioned to achieve greater success while staying true to their mission of providing excellent solutions to clients and fostering growth for their people and communities.\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nHere’s to a successful 2025!\n</p>\n', '', '2025-03-25 09:52:30', '2025-03-25 09:52:30'),
(42, 1, '[{\"name\":\"lcs-team-with-partner-school (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1gbSuS_0xmI57AegUA2OOz8H4c0evCo3M\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:56:53\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1kBPdISICadkiZFZbJ_zz8cuMAAoClNOo\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:56:56\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1DBikGZoFJPpDSJA3CqiUDDa7u3vkrmDv\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:56:59\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-11.jpg\",\"id\":\"1QrKdx7ALzoBwKTxaGm2_pM66Igo1872s\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:02\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-12.jpg\",\"id\":\"1F_HYLBuQDuBE4QsiBuRJWZrdvWf8jiXs\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:06\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-13.jpg\",\"id\":\"1PvaAmtKH0qwl7cJ3i9ylkfYYMlRfY5tG\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:09\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-14.jpg\",\"id\":\"10iMlYLv2luGf0w9iAKcn7PuESj-nRuQn\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:12\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-15.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Iq1macKxothw0PipcpJgwvoxeY0TZd0a\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:16\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-16.jpg\",\"id\":\"1PeUWhws86zt3oxTLsj9wnaVeDLAi4xVF\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:19\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-17.jpg\",\"id\":\"1b9WHhzuevTjMLPpTopliTqF1HBhzyLVn\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:23\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-18.jpg\",\"id\":\"1C-E6Hkm4oVPM1e9EeYt0W3xqYlrG6Hb_\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:26\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-19.jpg\",\"id\":\"19C7kQFHWuOLEbitV3dowgJ3ms6Gz1yqi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:30\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"12TxkAA1PK2aHXajT3zNSaGeUWvf4Afrp\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:36\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1gkyTQLw4Q9izu9K4_nsm98vI2uJf87Ag\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:39\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1YR5Dyw4DVyxgttdt_bpjx_xJQOL3tTAW\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:43\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1hnd0AIteWA1mqjWD_J7XIp1i1y7yLQyV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:46\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1rPPQmbZ9gMBm8wVKeUGXiQAkZBws5n28\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:49\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1mDjtnRFpf4WTam5BpuylAwI4Qb3SXKPD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:52\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1YBmAHEp3EhUpXH6VpfP-E-PurZMfocu2\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:55\"},{\"name\":\"lcss-student-from-saint-therese-image-9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1OC65u7ASUw8HiHYFpMFHv42y3HV2KZIs\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 09:57:59\"}]', 'Partnership', 'Renewed Partnership with St. Therese Montessori School of San Pablo, Inc. for Senior High School Work Immersion 2025', 'Renewed-Partnership-with-St.-Therese-Montessori-School-of-San-Pablo,-Inc.-for-Senior-High-School-Wor', '2025-01-23', ' <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. (FBS) is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with St. Therese Montessori School of San Pablo, Inc. for their Senior High School Work Immersion Program this 2025. This continued collaboration underscores both institutions\' shared commitment to providing students with invaluable real-world experience and practical skills that will prepare them for future career success.\n</p>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nAs part of this partnership, FBS will host Senior High School students from the STEM, ABM, and HUMSS strands, offering tailored work immersion opportunities designed to align with their respective academic tracks. The program aims to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and actual workplace application, ensuring that students are not only academically equipped but also industry-ready upon graduation.\n</p>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<b>\nWork Immersion Opportunities for Senior High School Students\n</b>\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n   <li>\n     <b>STEM (Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics):</b>\n    <p> Students from the STEM strand will delve into the field of <b>Web Design and Development</b>, gaining hands-on experience in creating and maintaining websites, learning the latest technologies, and developing practical problem-solving skills essential in the IT industry.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n     <b>ABM (Accountancy, Business, and Management):</b>\n    <p> Students from the ABM strand will engage in tasks related to <b>Accounting</b> and <b>Administrative</b> and <b>Management Roles</b>, providing them with insights into financial processes, organizational management, and strategic planning within a professional setting.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n     <b>HUMSS (Humanities and Social Sciences):</b>\n    <p>HUMSS students will have opportunities to work on <b>Administrative and Management Tasks</b>, enhancing their communication, organization, and interpersonal skills. These tasks will provide a deeper understanding of operations and coordination within a business environment.\n</p>\n   </li>\n<ul>\n\n<p  style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\"><b>Enhancing Skills and Shaping Futures\n</b></p>\n\n<p>The Work Immersion Program at FBS is structured to provide:\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n   <li><b>Real-world exposure:</b> Students will collaborate with experienced professionals, gaining practical knowledge and skills.\n</li>\n   <li><b>Mentorship:</b> Dedicated mentors will guide students, offering constructive feedback and career advice.\n</li>\n   <li><b>Hands-on training:</b> Participants will work on actual projects and tasks relevant to their chosen fields, preparing them for the demands of the professional world.\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThis partnership reflects FBS’s mission to holistically equip the next generation of professionals, fostering a culture of excellence, innovation, and service. By hosting students in this program, FBS also reinforces its commitment to the local community and education sector, helping shape a workforce that is both skilled and adaptable to industry needs.\n</p>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<b>A Continued Commitment to Excellence\n</b>\n</p>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. extends its gratitude to St. Therese Montessori School of San Pablo, Inc. for entrusting their students to FBS once again. This partnership is a testament to the trust and confidence shared between the two institutions, and we look forward to another successful year of nurturing talents and fostering growth.\n</p>\n\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nTogether, we continue to build a brighter future for the youth, empowering them to thrive in their chosen careers while contributing meaningfully to society.\n</p>\n\n\n', '', '2025-03-25 09:56:50', '2025-03-25 09:56:50'),
(43, 1, '[{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-group-picture.jpg\",\"id\":\"1WoPmoUrI2b7eynuDbJjaZqU0ItgzqZ8y\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:40\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-group-picture-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1VX9AbIyCPh-7jY0DMZgSwJJ72bmmdaxz\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:46\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1yrXLQeH5LS21CQ1GANQif9SEmyFXKtdA\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:49\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1HnKZBrOL9IQLU2MCMEL-zR6gyrxjDJwZ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:52\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-11.jpg\",\"id\":\"1YYBihrp6aCaMKYEfOPtrvpWmI1zMIhbi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:56\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"18IoJLuVacYDYQgxQnO0F7n0WVCkL-4jM\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:02:59\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1fCGZYSYcZfD0uxICHZGn3xNuWnjKW2yW\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:02\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1skXM09I735b6MuF9dXoNBVu-EvNcTt3N\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:05\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1ImpwBhHG7zr9Cn-HnI2ObWg1mtMhwyXu\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:08\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"18a6x1PFVpyGry0CGD-0MCaPFXoSSFbGD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:12\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"18LRlCtV_HiiPT6LUlautqAojT8Rm6VBF\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:16\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1XT3rOtvRNdCKGTMdhFNricbOsmbCqaKW\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:19\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-image-9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1IqIXN6SNVDD2KKyicp5M2Hl9wfM2naWR\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:23\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1mwjx6cidXsFjTkn-PHRAwoZ_EtXYaZTm\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:26\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1L-SXd7wtCmt4Z3VdZrKxLcWcd9tjXJ97\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:29\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1ql1krwmz4a8kaqzgMwIfQmy2MQGzdalk\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:33\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"112AjTtpoJPgEPvtXgvQSNlLxvPWb3L-B\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:36\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1wQYdal9L7mg3t4rPFghjGlmEo_3iHVGH\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:39\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Jat7v9qpl7gDMACqrC-PEm34SO6laxLb\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:42\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Ix6-6al1udgVO4T3YETo3HbzTrDMydw7\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:45\"},{\"name\":\"ideal-team-player-seminar-marticipant-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1EuTRbkWB_pqBKoK45EES6txD2gPWj9ud\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:03:48\"}]', 'Activities', 'Employee Development Program: The Ideal Team Player Seminar', 'employee-development-program-the-ideal-team-player-seminar', '2025-01-09', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nRecently, the newly hired employees of Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. participated in an inspiring Employee Development Program centered on The Ideal Team Player, based on Patrick Lencioni\'s renowned book. The session, facilitated by Mr. Jhonny Jose Dichoso, Head of the Learning Center Solutions department, highlighted the three key virtues that define an ideal team player: being humble, hungry, and smart. As part of its commitment to holistic employee growth, Frontline Business Solutions aims for its workforce to embody these virtues, fostering a collaborative and high-performing organizational culture.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe program included interactive discussions, practical activities, and real-life applications of the virtues, ensuring that participants gained a deeper understanding of their significance. Mr. Dichoso emphasized that humility nurtures teamwork, hunger drives excellence, and being smart enhances interpersonal dynamics—all of which are essential for personal and team success. By instilling these values, Frontline Business Solutions reaffirms its mission to develop employees who not only contribute to the company\'s success but also create a positive impact within the workplace and the communities they serve.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nExplanation of the Three Virtues:\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<b>Humble:</b> Humility is about putting the team’s success above personal glory. Humble employees recognize others\' contributions, own up to their mistakes, and strive for collective achievement over individual accolades.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<b>Hungry:</b> Hunger reflects an innate drive for continuous improvement and excellence. Hungry employees are self-motivated, diligent, and eager to go above and beyond to meet team and organizational goals.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<b>Smart:</b> Being smart refers to emotional intelligence and strong interpersonal skills. Smart employees understand team dynamics, communicate effectively, and manage relationships with empathy and tact.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThrough this program, Frontline Business Solutions empowers its employees to embrace these virtues, shaping them into ideal team players ready to contribute to the company’s mission and vision.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 10:02:37', '2025-03-25 10:02:37'),
(44, 1, '[{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-16.jpg\",\"id\":\"1s9C1FKDq3LK5L-jcd_Sd6rYqui5Gt-3J\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:01\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1gqfWkp-iv5JyMQfT1GHcj8IAmm3beFFi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:05\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Ft-wDOKMFdDG_1RN_WXaAX34sN2pAIzA\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:08\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-11.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Cnu9KoiI8fgbXJJZOgM-JLBbm6qV3rFr\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:11\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-12.jpg\",\"id\":\"1a5hdWGoVoWJIoOnz3LWTlQkqaLrsilb7\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:15\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-13.jpg\",\"id\":\"1qq1-nXkoiVpAWc7hS0_CsOAfgph-gt9G\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:18\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-14.jpg\",\"id\":\"1M1mNXDbxTif-Mf1oBQGCqiBUEvG8ylqs\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:21\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-15.jpg\",\"id\":\"1HrFV0IiSEd4Qu17wXEW2MKqodPZkrthr\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:25\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-17.jpg\",\"id\":\"1XcT_ikwJW68RFdTQvhXsYAkBQXpdu9lC\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:29\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-18.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Fx3syeErIaFDih_uMjHWY6sqsbYqzrpk\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:32\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-19.jpg\",\"id\":\"11tttE-9ss_UIUg3WnCNuRuGbrvEcEczU\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:36\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1TpK5PiFdTKbjyBln9VRItY54AAFppOBX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:39\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-20.jpg\",\"id\":\"1nOSTPWd1JLnL7J-TA0sqBskB76ersaj1\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:42\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-21.jpg\",\"id\":\"1i0yyLZU2YdkLv-5S3HPDyaSB_3Ig_jiY\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:46\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1KHSOHdMvIVR-knQOomCLy_ZhiQC9FwWN\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:49\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1B5-pnOVmUtzxuvRxcdUFqjRlHjEA28Nx\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:52\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1eB24NqoCihilHlPQfhxmGzesxGCDKDPD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:56\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1qreo4IeQsApF_1GPHE1g30sss0X8XxtO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:08:59\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1NlV7q6OcmxfH_pNEupR2lFTh8dtHDNvr\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:09:02\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1EXyG4uPTD3HKhM7UOcUAsqouDV2L0UG0\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:09:07\"},{\"name\":\"fbs-christmas-party-image-9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1xkyel_1mXQv32IQQTK0LSbaRDFlbVBd9\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:09:10\"}]', 'Events', 'Christmas Party 2024', 'christmas-party-2024', '2025-01-06', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions, Inc. celebrated its highly anticipated Christmas Party 2024 with a delightful \"Back to School\" theme, bringing out the youthful spirit in everyone. Employees donned school uniforms, adding charm and nostalgia to the festivities. The event was packed with excitement, featuring vibrant performances from each department, creatively aligned with the theme, showcasing their talent and teamwork. This yearly celebration continues to be a highlight for employees, fostering camaraderie and holiday cheer.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe party also recognized excellence and dedication through the awarding of the Outstanding Employee of the Year for each department, applauding those who went above and beyond in their roles. Additionally, a special Service Award was given to employees who marked their fifth year with the company, honoring their unwavering commitment and contributions. The event was a perfect mix of fun, recognition, and team spirit, embodying the values and culture of Frontline Business Solutions as it celebrated another successful year.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 10:07:57', '2025-03-25 10:07:57'),
(45, 1, '[{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_6 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1GBoP5Usw5hskTXDdq1p6Yz-n0byi696P\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:01\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_10 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1cN-p-vIyFXdq2kcuRQ_c6qemp_zy9i97\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:04\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_2 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"10gDP74kxtZCyTmC8UBIFxPA-UETpj7nX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:07\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_3 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1oPgqNNEA2dSZyOa4VdJcyVIhM7JJMw2v\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:11\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_4 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1eSRN5teCnTtvjUMPGyYVV7spHFBjp1CK\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:14\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_5 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"12aFu8ZGNN01dLLNsvYj1dIs2tYQ-fH7R\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:17\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_7 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1hfdJA4GegDCTLDPibPrKQ4fUoV39q2Yt\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:20\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_8 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1cIl-rbXvKQDUAS1DqW0LYAeJaMvQd36L\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:23\"},{\"name\":\"ojt_and_work_immersion_with_sir_robert_image_9 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1bf6o1SNuti2A0I3b403Oy2YM4dzSWA78\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:16:27\"}]', 'Activities', 'OJT and Work Immersion Students Learn Valuable Lessons from Sir Robert Han', 'ojt-and-work-immersion-students-learn-valuable-lessons-from-sir-robert-han', '2024-12-02', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nOur work immersion and OJT students had the extraordinary opportunity to meet Sir Robert Han, a partner at Frontline Business Solutions and the COO of Two Miles. With over 30 years of experience in operations, finance, accounting, consulting, and advisory services, Sir Robert is a seasoned professional whose journey embodies dedication and excellence. Beyond his corporate achievements, he has made significant contributions to various non-profit organizations and has served as an ordained elder, lay pastor, and treasurer for Cornerstone Bible Church in Fullerton, CA, for nearly 15 years.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nDuring the session, Sir Robert shared powerful insights on achieving true success, emphasizing the importance of balancing professional growth with spiritual fulfillment. He encouraged the students to seek God as life’s greatest purpose while striving for excellence in their careers. Through his inspiring words and personal stories, Sir Robert left a lasting impact on the students, motivating them to pursue a life of meaning, integrity, and purpose. This event marked a significant milestone in their journey toward becoming future-ready professionals.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 10:15:58', '2025-03-25 10:15:58'),
(46, 1, '[{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"13x-Q-2zdsS0y4x4Gmddl_nX-jILMEbLq\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:09\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-1.jpg\",\"id\":\"1MvKgcUowTSq4Z-Qs3BeFHggVsSRNS5lO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:12\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1s6cbxH3Sr-J0dnBfPeCI8eIySgYk-BUO\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:15\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Waja0UlJ4huy1NFM7T-Avw0BkUbSv0Ur\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:18\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1dRTUY8Mco5FxqXhQ1R791AK6851kgDO0\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:22\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-5 (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1S8_QfXQwgZ3lKfrKsql10RLnqeFl0RIE\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:25\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Bv3dAgFeleWxP-hYXhyINkyU3-jAG6ni\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:28\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"10dPoW--Sl54iPU5zujw-lDykp5FmJXhZ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:31\"},{\"name\":\"lcs-visits-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"16j3_x9D1jnjL68GJYmncqU_cPqArWdqS\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:20:35\"}]', 'Partnership', 'LCS School Visits', 'lcs-school-visits', '2024-10-31', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">Our Learning Center Solutions Team embarked on an inspiring journey to visit several educational institutions, presenting the many opportunities our Learning Center Solutions Department has to offer. Our team introduced innovative programs for college on-the-job training and senior high school work immersion, with a focus on creating impactful partnerships that empower students through practical learning experiences.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">We are deeply grateful to the schools that welcomed us with open arms: Marcelino Fule Memorial College, St. Therese Montessori School of San Pablo, Inc., St. Nicolas Golden Field Academy Inc., LSPU-San Pablo City Campus, ACLC College of San Pablo City Campus, San Pablo Colleges, and Asian Institute of Technology and Education. Your trust and enthusiasm reinforce our mission to support students’ growth and development.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">A heartfelt thank you goes to our dedicated team members—Mr. Ansbert Gregana, Ms. Herlyn Torres, and Ms. Thea Lyzette Consignado—whose passion and commitment, under the expert guidance of Mr. Jhonny Dichoso, drive the success of these partnerships. Together, we are shaping a brighter future for the next generation of professionals.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">Our programs are designed to develop technical skills, professionalism, and ethical qualities—key competencies for students to excel in the industry. With these foundational qualities, we’re here to support students as they embark on their career journeys.</p>', '', '2025-03-25 10:20:06', '2025-03-25 10:20:06'),
(47, 1, '[{\"name\":\"company-retreat-2024.jpg\",\"id\":\"1i5FtFkuVuui9Awyhm8jROknN0dpurHcc\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:25:21\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"company-retreat-2024.jpg\",\"id\":\"1L7AqbBKc59X8WJ0rKvU6r1X1-dXOwSC0\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 10:28:23\"}]', 'Events', 'Company Retreat 2024', 'company-retreat-2024', '2024-10-31', '<p>We took this time to deeply reflect on the significance of glorifying God through our work. Each daily task presents an opportunity to showcase His love and grace, reminding us that our efforts can touch lives in meaningful ways. We emphasized the importance of integrity in serving others, as it fosters trust within our team. Aligning our work with God\'s purpose brings a deeper meaning to our roles, inspiring us to make a positive impact not just within our team but in the communities we serve. We are reminded that our work is a calling, a chance to reflect His light in everything that we do.</p>\n\n<p>As a company of faith, we are committed to nurturing an environment where spiritual values guide our actions and decisions, promoting unity and a sense of family among us. Each moment shared strengthens our bonds and empowers us to pursue our mission with renewed passion.</p>\n\n<p>Let’s carry this spirit forward, recognizing that our collective efforts can create change in the world around us. Here’s to continuing our mission together and making a lasting difference!</p>', '', '2025-03-25 10:25:18', '2025-03-25 10:28:18'),
(48, 1, '[{\"name\":\"The-Ideal-Team-Player-Seminar-3-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":\"1ATQSr9SzGKGnSRaEdF8lP956VmtM8uxx\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:19:00\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"The-Ideal-Team-Player-Seminar-3-scaled (1).jpg\",\"id\":\"1QWqHokQkOMpAk-7nJdZ0Uz-Qqt4cJCQi\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:19:03\"}]', 'Events', 'The Ideal Team Player Seminar', 'the-ideal-team-player-seminar', '2024-10-31', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">In order to foster a thriving and harmonious work environment, the Learning Center Solutions team, led by Mr. Jhonny Jose Dichoso, conducted an engaging and insightful seminar on “The Ideal Team Player: Embracing Humble, Hungry, and Smart Virtues.” The seminar aimed to explore the significance of these three virtues and their application in building effective teams and achieving organizational success.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">The seminar also identified the categories of employees who might lack or be deficient in these virtues, such as individuals who are overly self-centered, lack initiative, or struggle with interpersonal dynamics.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">To deepen the understanding of these virtues and foster practical application, the seminar featured engaging group discussions and activities. Participants were encouraged to share experiences and scenarios where these virtues played pivotal roles in team dynamics and outcomes. Through group activities and exercises, attendees practiced being humble, hungry, and smart, honing their skills in communication, empathy, and collaboration.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">Furthermore, the seminar emphasized the Four Primary Applications of the ideal team player framework: Hiring, Assessing, Developing and Embedding</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">In conclusion, the seminar on “The Ideal Team Player” by the Learning Center Solutions team provided invaluable insights into building strong, high-performing teams. By fostering a culture of humility, drive, and emotional intelligence, organizations can create a winning environment where team members complement each other’s strengths and work synergistically towards achieving shared goals.</p>', '', '2025-03-25 12:18:56', '2025-03-25 12:18:56'),
(49, 1, '[{\"name\":\"5th-year-thumb_3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1_tAXxKxKsA3zPEwPdsdguX7F1QRhiMgo\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:20:53\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"5th-year-thumb_3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1ldQqMgp8lJeSyVidJEm5IsmNYuFN19p0\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:28:01\"}]', 'Events', 'Fifth Year Anniversary', 'fifth-year-anniversary', '2024-10-30', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  We’ve come a long way since then, adding new services like Virtual Office and\n  a Learning Center to support education and skill development. The pandemic\n  brought challenges, but we adapted by working remotely without letting go of\n  our team or clients. This difficult time showed our strength and the trust our\n  clients have in us, helping us grow and make a difference in our community.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  As we celebrate five years, we’re proud and grateful. Our goal has always been\n  more than just business – it’s about doing business for good. Looking forward,\n  we’re excited to keep making a positive impact on lives and businesses. Here’s\n  to five years of growth, strength, and service, and to many more years of\n  making a positive change. Cheers to Frontline Business Solutions, where every\n  day is a chance to make a difference.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; display: flex; justify-content: center\">\n  <iframe\n    width=\"560\"\n    height=\"315\"\n    src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gReHchZNERM?si=0VpXHIQzrF09WC_A\"\n    title=\"YouTube video player\"\n    frameborder=\"0\"\n    allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n    referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n    allowfullscreen\n  ></iframe>\n</p>\n', '', '2025-03-25 12:20:50', '2025-03-25 12:27:57'),
(50, 1, '[{\"name\":\"img_3348-1080x550.jpg\",\"id\":\"1_uk0GHLzu81Zi0_GeRxF1QGyD358_xDs\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:11\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"sti-1.webp\",\"id\":\"1RbYv9mbucBcXdi5GGopvDYAt-rbDe38r\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:14\"},{\"name\":\"sti-15.webp\",\"id\":\"1K39fZDcNPACzdRoPddqhrpiy_frKkFDw\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:18\"},{\"name\":\"sti-5.webp\",\"id\":\"1SdwoJbD3AUfrw-fSdxY76GmwNwap3p4w\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:23\"},{\"name\":\"sti-6.webp\",\"id\":\"1tDLTNIMCFV5nNPTsR5uo48SKoZyH8K8b\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:27\"},{\"name\":\"sti-7.webp\",\"id\":\"1mht6NrBBnI3lVFMKV0BLj14AYRtPvTt8\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:30\"},{\"name\":\"sti-8.webp\",\"id\":\"19W7zIYRUJXmF0RHq7rlazBjtQahCkqUI\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:34\"},{\"name\":\"sti-9.webp\",\"id\":\"1SfFa22RzpAjw8XOe7shs5RF_YWSVMAxT\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:24:37\"}]', 'Partnership', 'Annual Career Fest 2024 at STI College', 'annual-career-fest-2024-at-sti-college-cavite', '2024-10-03', '<p>We are thrilled to share our recent participation in the Annual Career Fest 2024 at STI College San Pablo, an event dedicated to connecting graduating students with potential career opportunities.</p>\n\n<p>Our company proudly offers aspiring young professionals in the field of IT a gateway to enter the industry of web development. Our booth attracted numerous applicants eager to become full-stack developers. We were fortunate to provide job opportunities to students from BS Information Technology, BS Computer Science, and BS Computer Engineering programs. This event also paved the way for us to build a strong partnership with STI College San Pablo, enhancing our efforts in talent acquisition and contributing to the field of Information Technology. We look forward to continuing our collaboration with STI College San Pablo and supporting the next generation of IT professionals.</p>', '', '2025-03-25 12:24:09', '2025-03-25 12:24:09'),
(51, 1, '[{\"name\":\"team-building-2024.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Go2I6pCIZd-gdymwWNwzP_Cj_Zv4LUFQ\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:29:11\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"team-building-2024.jpg\",\"id\":\"1aFsYkkMCn1hrsnwV-m3kpok9UnfonsH8\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 12:29:37\"}]', 'Company Activities', 'Team Building 2024', 'team-building-2024', '2024-08-07', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  From May 15 to 17, our team gathered at La Luz Beach Resort for our 2024\n  Company Team Building. The event was packed with engaging activities aimed at\n  fostering camaraderie and teamwork.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  We kicked off with inspiring messages from our administrators and client\n  visitors, setting a positive tone. The retreat featured a variety of games,\n  including tug of war, beach volleyball, and a “Drum Whole” competition,\n  highlighting the importance of teamwork, synchronization, and creativity. The\n  lively “Family Feud” game and the spirited yell competition showcased our team\n  spirit and enthusiasm.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  The retreat concluded with reflections from our administrators and client\n  visitors, who emphasized the growth in our team dynamics over the past days.\n  As we departed from La Luz Beach Resort, we felt a renewed sense of unity and\n  commitment to supporting each other, ready to tackle future challenges\n  together with enhanced teamwork and shared purpose.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 12:29:08', '2025-03-25 12:29:32'),
(52, 0, '[{\"name\":\"Placeholder-_-Glossary.svg\",\"id\":\"1uTv6Vk0bhG3g7WybQuNcglprcBqO7MhU\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 13:12:15\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"Placeholder-_-Glossary.svg\",\"id\":\"1QR2GSGaQrdYq2CYihHQBHlAOesrxX5wB\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-25 13:12:18\"}]', 'Events', 'We Celebrate March Fellowship in Honor of Women\'s Month', 'We-Celebrate-March-Fellowship-in-Honor-of-Women\'s-Month', '2025-03-28', '<p style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\nIn celebration of Women\'s Month this March, Frontline Business Solutions (FBS) gathered for a special company fellowship, embracing the theme of empowerment and unity. Employees came together wearing purple-themed attire, symbolizing justice and dignity—values strongly associated with the global Women\'s Month celebration.\n</p>\n\n<p><b>A Day of Togetherness and Recognition</b></p>\n\n<p>\nThe fellowship kicked off with an assembly for a group picture, capturing the vibrant spirit of the FBS family. This was followed by the opening program, which began with a heartfelt prayer and warm opening remarks from Mrs. Rhoda Beloso, our HR Manager.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\nA bittersweet moment followed as we took time to honor and pray for our colleagues who will be leaving the company. We expressed our gratitude and well-wishes for Sir Ansbert Gregana (IT Trainer and Web Developer), Sir Mark Christopher Bumagat (WordPress Developer), and Sir Mark Ryan Merin (Fullstack Developer), recognizing their valuable contributions to the team.\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Exciting Games and Employee Recognition</b></p>\n\n<p>\nThe atmosphere turned lively as employees engaged in fun and interactive games. The Makeup Challenge brought out creativity and laughter, while the Calamansi Relay Game tested teamwork and coordination. The fellowship also served as an opportunity to recognize excellence, as we proudly awarded the Employee(s) of the Month, celebrating their hard work and dedication.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">\nFollowing the fun-filled activities, we announced the winners of the games and recognized the employee with the Best Attire, showcasing the creativity and enthusiasm of our team in embracing the theme.\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Closing and Fellowship Over Food</b></p>\n\n<p>\nThe event concluded with a closing prayer and birthday announcements, ensuring that we celebrated not only Women’s Month but also the milestones of our employees. Finally, everyone enjoyed a time of fellowship over food, strengthening the bonds that make FBS a family.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nThis March fellowship was not just a celebration but a reminder of the importance of unity, appreciation, and empowerment in the workplace. As we move forward, we continue to embrace inclusivity and excellence, fostering a culture where every individual is valued.\n</p>', '', '2025-03-25 13:12:11', '2025-05-22 10:35:37');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_events_activities` (`events_activities_aid`, `events_activities_is_active`, `events_activities_img`, `events_activities_img_list`, `events_activities_category`, `events_activities_title`, `events_activities_slug`, `events_activities_date`, `events_activities_description`, `events_activities_meta_description`, `events_activities_created`, `events_activities_datetime`) VALUES
(55, 0, '[{\"name\":\"placeholder-image.jpg\",\"id\":\"174gRoYBA5ASSOAaq3Gkvi0FEFOSiWljo\",\"datetime\":\"2025-05-22 09:20:17\"}]', '', 'Events', 'Celebrating the Completion of Our Full-Stack Development and Accounting Associate Interns from STI College San Pablo, Laguna State Polytechnic University – San Pablo City Campus, and De La Salle Lipa', 'celebrating-ojt-completion', '2025-05-22', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n             We proudly recognize and celebrate the successful completion of the on-the-job training (OJT) of our <b>Full-Stack Development</b> and <b>Accounting Associate</b> interns from <b>STI College San Pablo</b>, <b>Laguna State Polytechnic University – San Pablo City Campus</b>, and <b>De La Salle Lipa</b>. These students have completed their internship journey with <b>Frontline Business Solutions, Inc.</b>, equipped not only with technical competencies but also with real-world experience that bridges academic learning with industry standards.\n            </p>\n            \n\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 20px;\">\n                <b>Full-Stack Development Interns</b>  \n            </p>\n            \n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px\">\n                Throughout their internship, our full-stack development interns were able to apply and master a comprehensive set of learning outcomes, including:  \n            </p>\n\n           <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 60px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n  <li><strong>Designing Website Mockups and UI using Figma</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Developing Responsive Web Designs</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Converting Mockup Designs into Actual Web Pages using HTML and CSS</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Applying Basic Scripting Language using JavaScript</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Utilizing SASS Technology in Website Conversion</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Building Website Layouts Efficiently using Tailwind CSS Utility Classes</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Converting Static Websites into WordPress Websites</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Developing Frontend Applications using ReactJS</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Understanding and Using Props, State, and Store Context in ReactJS</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Performing MySQL Operations including CRUD, CORS Configuration, and API Integration</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Contributing to Actual ReactJS Project Development</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n             With the guidance of our dedicated mentors and developers, these students participated in real-life projects that enhanced their technical capabilities while also honing essential soft skills such as teamwork, time management, and problem-solving—key ingredients for success in the dynamic field of technology.\n            </p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 20px;\">\n                <b>Accounting Associate Interns</b>  \n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px\">\n                Alongside our tech interns, our <b>Accounting Associate interns</b> demonstrated significant development in their understanding and application of foundational and advanced accounting concepts. Their learning outcomes included:  \n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 60px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                <li><strong>Basic Bookkeeping</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Understanding and Applying the Advanced Functions of MS Excel</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Creating and Filling Out Accounting Source Documents</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Participating in Budget Control and Monitoring Processes</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Understanding Business Registration Processes (Sole Proprietorship, Partnership, Corporation)</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Learning the Components and Importance of Income Tax Returns (Philippine Taxation)</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Filing Common Philippine Business Tax Forms</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Understanding the Basic Functions and Features of QuickBooks Online</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Filing of Various US Tax Return Forms</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Understanding the Basic Components of US Payroll</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Gaining Familiarity with Xero Accounting Software</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Understanding the Components of a Payroll and Preparing a Philippine Payroll Report</strong></li>\n                <li><strong>Creating Financial Projection Reports</strong></li>\n            </ul>\n \n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n             They worked alongside our accounting professionals to experience real-world applications in both Philippine and international contexts—giving them a broader perspective and a solid foundation for a career in finance and accounting.\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n             We are grateful for the opportunity to contribute to the growth and development of these future professionals. To our interns—your <b>passion</b>, <b>dedication</b>, and <b>eagerness to learn</b> have been truly commendable. You are now better equipped to move forward with confidence in your respective fields, and we are honored to have been part of your journey.\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n             <b>Congratulations</b> on a job well done, and thank you for choosing Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. as your training ground!\n            </p>\n', '', '2025-05-22 09:20:13', '2025-05-22 10:19:27'),
(56, 1, '[{\"name\":\"Group 17 (1).webp\",\"id\":\"1sg2nMav2WUIXRuuEH08o_5Xrtkp3svhv\",\"datetime\":\"2025-11-20 11:53:07\"}]', '', 'Test', 'Test Title', 'test-title', '2025-11-20', 'Testssssss', 'test meta descriptionssss', '2025-11-20 11:53:03', '2025-11-20 12:25:11');

